IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il38-nouns`

-- Courts Law [Consolidated Version], 5744-1984: ss 2, 2A, 6, 6B, 6C, 7(b), 7(c), 8, 14, 25. Row IL-38. Target compiler: main.
-- Each rule takes its vintage as an input where the two texts differ. The text from the 26th Knesset is Amendment No. 105 (SH 3389 pp. 438-440), which Amendment No. 105 s 8(a)
-- starts on the day Basic Law: The Judiciary (Amendment No. 4) starts: the first day of the 26th Knesset's term.

§ `Section 2: who may be a Supreme Court judge`

-- s 2: אלה כשירים להתמנות לשופטי בית המשפט העליון: (1) מי שכיהן במשך תקופה של חמש שנים כשופט בית משפט מחוזי; (2) מי שרשום, ומי שזכאי להיות רשום, בפנקס חברי לשכת עורכי הדין ועסק, ברציפות או לסירוגין,
--   לא פחות מעשר שנים, מהן לפחות חמש שנים בארץ, באחד או באחדים מן הדברים האלה: ...; (3) משפטאי מובהק.
@ref Courts Law s 2(1), (2), (3)
GIVEN person IS A `A candidate for the Supreme Court`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is eligible to be a Supreme Court judge` MEANS
    person's `years served as a judge of a district court` AT LEAST 5
    OR (person's `years on the Bar's register or entitled to be, practising in a capacity s 2(2) lists` AT LEAST 10 AND person's `of those years, years in Israel` AT LEAST 5)
    OR person's `is a distinguished jurist`

§ `Section 2A: cooling-off, and unanimity for a candidate under 55`

-- s 2A (both vintages, as (a) from the 26th Knesset): לא יתמנה לשופט בית המשפט העליון מי שכיהן בתפקיד היועץ המשפטי לממשלה או פרקליט המדינה, אלא אם כן עברה תקופה של שמונה עשר חודשים מיום סיום כהונתו.
@ref Courts Law s 2A, s 2A(a)
GIVEN `the person served as Attorney General or State Attorney` IS A BOOLEAN
      `whole months since that term ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cooling-off of 18 months is over` MEANS
    (NOT `the person served as Attorney General or State Attorney`) OR (`whole months since that term ended` AT LEAST 18)

-- s 2A(b), from the 26th Knesset (Amendment No. 105 s 1(2), SH 3389 p. 438): בחירה של הוועדה לבחירת שופטים בשופט לבית המשפט העליון שטרם מלאו לו 55 שנים תהיה בהחלטה שהתקבלה על דעת כל החברים המכהנים בוועדה.
-- s 8(b) of the Amendment: 2A(b) does not apply to a judge appointed to the Supreme Court before commencement.
-- This rule is a function of its own: it takes the counts as inputs and does not call the Basic Law's majority rule, which row IL-37 encodes.
@ref Courts Law s 2A(b); Amendment No. 105 s 1(2), s 8(b)
GIVEN vintage IS A `A vintage of the Courts Law text`
      `the age in whole years` IS A NUMBER
      `the person was appointed to the Supreme Court before commencement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of members serving` IS A NUMBER
      `the number voting in favour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the choice of a Supreme Court judge meets section 2A(b)` MEANS
    IF vintage EQUALS `the text before the 26th Knesset`
    THEN TRUE
    ELSE IF `the person was appointed to the Supreme Court before commencement`
         THEN TRUE
         ELSE IF `the age in whole years` LESS THAN 55
              THEN `the number voting in favour` EQUALS `the number of members serving`
              ELSE TRUE

§ `Section 6: who chooses the Knesset members and the public representatives, and the women among them`

-- s 6(1), (2) from the 26th Knesset: the Knesset members elect by secret ballot the two Knesset members (one of the coalition factions, chosen by the coalition Knesset members; one of the opposition factions, chosen by
-- the opposition Knesset members) and the two public representatives (one chosen by the coalition Knesset members, one by the opposition Knesset members; and if s 4(f) of the Basic Law applies, both chosen by the Knesset).
-- Before: the Knesset elects two Knesset members by secret ballot; the Bar's National Council elects its two representatives by secret ballot, for three years.
@ref Courts Law s 6(1), (2); Amendment No. 105 s 2(1)
GIVEN vintage IS A `A vintage of the Courts Law text`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of Knesset members the Knesset elects to the committee` MEANS
    2

-- Definitions, s 6 from the 26th Knesset: "the coalition factions" are the factions in the Knesset that are parties to agreements binding support for the Government; "the opposition factions" are those that are not.
@ref Courts Law s 6, definitions; Amendment No. 105 s 2(4)
GIVEN `the faction is a party to an agreement binding it to support the Government` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the faction is one of the coalition factions` MEANS
    `the faction is a party to an agreement binding it to support the Government`

GIVEN `the faction is a party to an agreement binding it to support the Government` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the faction is one of the opposition factions` MEANS
    NOT `the faction is a party to an agreement binding it to support the Government`

-- s 6(3A) before: at least one woman among each of: the Supreme Court justices, the Government's representatives, the Knesset's representatives, the Bar's representatives.
-- s 6(3A) from the 26th Knesset: the first two only. s 6(3B), from the 26th Knesset: at least one woman among the members the coalition Knesset members chose and one among those the opposition Knesset members chose;
-- if s 4(f) of the Basic Law applies, (3B) does not apply but at least one of the public representatives the Knesset chose is a woman.
@ref Courts Law s 6(3A), s 6(3B); Amendment No. 105 s 2(2), (3)
GIVEN vintage IS A `A vintage of the Courts Law text`
      `the coalition factions number more than 80 Knesset members` IS A BOOLEAN
      women IS A `Women on the committee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the gender requirement of section 6 is met` MEANS
    IF vintage EQUALS `the text before the 26th Knesset`
    THEN women's `women among the Supreme Court justices` AT LEAST 1
         AND women's `women among the Government's representatives` AT LEAST 1
         AND women's `women among the Knesset's representatives, before the 26th Knesset` AT LEAST 1
         AND women's `women among the Bar's representatives, before the 26th Knesset` AT LEAST 1
    ELSE IF `the coalition factions number more than 80 Knesset members`
         THEN women's `women among the Supreme Court justices` AT LEAST 1
              AND women's `women among the Government's representatives` AT LEAST 1
              AND women's `women among the public representatives the Knesset as a whole chose` AT LEAST 1
         ELSE women's `women among the Supreme Court justices` AT LEAST 1
              AND women's `women among the Government's representatives` AT LEAST 1
              AND women's `women among the members the coalition Knesset members chose` AT LEAST 1
              AND women's `women among the members the opposition Knesset members chose` AT LEAST 1

§ `Section 6B: changes in the committee during the Knesset's term (from the 26th Knesset)`

-- s 6B(a): עם כינון ממשלה חדשה בתקופת כהונתה של אותה כנסת או אם מספר חברי הכנסת הנמנים עם סיעות הקואליציה פחת ל־80 או למטה מזה או עלה על 80, ייבחרו לוועדה לבחירת שופטים חברים במקום החברים המנויים בסעיף 4(ב)(1)(ב) עד (ד) לחוק־יסוד: השפיטה.
@ref Courts Law s 6B(a); Amendment No. 105 s 3
GIVEN `a new Government was formed in the term of the Knesset` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the coalition's Knesset members before` IS A NUMBER
      `the coalition's Knesset members after` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`members must be chosen in place of the ministers, Knesset members and public representatives` MEANS
    `a new Government was formed in the term of the Knesset`
    OR (`the coalition's Knesset members before` GREATER THAN 80 AND `the coalition's Knesset members after` AT MOST 80)
    OR (`the coalition's Knesset members before` AT MOST 80 AND `the coalition's Knesset members after` GREATER THAN 80)

-- s 6B(c)(1): two thirds of the Knesset members counted among the coalition factions (or the opposition factions) may announce that another Knesset member be chosen in place of the one they chose.
@ref Courts Law s 6B(c)(1)
GIVEN `the Knesset members of that side who announce` IS A NUMBER
      `the Knesset members counted among that side` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`two thirds of that side announce` MEANS
    (`the Knesset members of that side who announce` TIMES 3) AT LEAST (`the Knesset members counted among that side` TIMES 2)

-- s 6B(d): בחירה לפי סעיף זה תתקיים בתוך 30 ימים ממועד היווצרות העילה לבחירה; פרטים ייקבעו בתקנון הכנסת.
@ref Courts Law s 6B(d)
GIVEN `the day the ground for the election arose` IS A DATE
      `the day of the election` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the election was held within 30 days of the ground` MEANS
    Day `the day of the election` AT MOST (Day `the day the ground for the election arose`) PLUS 30

§ `Section 6C: public representatives`

-- s 6C(a): כשיר להיבחר כנציג הציבור בוועדה מי שכשיר להתמנות לשופט בית המשפט העליון כאמור בסעיף 2.
@ref Courts Law s 6C(a); Amendment No. 105 s 3
GIVEN person IS A `A candidate for the Supreme Court`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is eligible to be chosen a public representative` MEANS
    `the person is eligible to be a Supreme Court judge` person

§ `Section 7: proposing candidates, and the old majority`

-- s 7(b) before: the Minister of Justice, the President of the Supreme Court, or three members of the committee as one. From the 26th Knesset: two members of the committee as one.
@ref Courts Law s 7(b); Amendment No. 105 s 4(1)
GIVEN vintage IS A `A vintage of the Courts Law text`
      proposer IS A `Who proposes candidates`
      `the number of members acting together` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the proposal of a candidate is by someone the text allows` MEANS
    CONSIDER proposer
    WHEN `the Minister of Justice` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the President of the Supreme Court` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `members of the committee acting together` THEN
        IF vintage EQUALS `the text before the 26th Knesset`
        THEN `the number of members acting together` AT LEAST 3
        ELSE `the number of members acting together` AT LEAST 2

-- s 7(c), before the 26th Knesset only (Amendment No. 105 s 4(2) repeals it; the Basic Law s 4(d), (e) take its place):
--   (1) הצעת הועדה על מינויו של שופט תהיה על דעת רוב חבריה שהשתתפו בהצבעה.
--   (2) על אף הוראות פסקה (1), הצעת הוועדה על מינוי של שופט לבית המשפט העליון תהיה על דעת שבעה מחברי הוועדה; פחת מספר המשתתפים בהצבעה מתשעה תהיה ההצבעה על דעת רוב המשתתפים שלא יפחת ממספר המשתתפים בהחסיר שניים.
-- From the 26th Knesset the answer is NOTHING: the subsection is repealed, and the majority is the Basic Law's.
@ref Courts Law s 7(c); Amendment No. 105 s 4(2)
GIVEN vintage IS A `A vintage of the Courts Law text`
      `the judge is of the Supreme Court` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number who took part in the vote` IS A NUMBER
      `the number in favour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the old majority of section 7(c) is met` MEANS
    IF vintage EQUALS `the text from the 26th Knesset`
    THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (repealed): section 7(c) is repealed from the 26th Knesset; Basic Law s 4(d), (e) apply
    ELSE IF `the judge is of the Supreme Court`
         THEN IF `the number who took part in the vote` EQUALS 9
              THEN JUST (`the number in favour` AT LEAST 7)
              ELSE JUST ((`the number in favour` TIMES 2) GREATER THAN `the number who took part in the vote` AND `the number in favour` AT LEAST (`the number who took part in the vote` MINUS 2))
         ELSE JUST ((`the number in favour` TIMES 2) GREATER THAN `the number who took part in the vote`)

§ `Section 8: the President and Deputy President of the Supreme Court`

-- s 8(a): appointed under s 4(a) of the Basic Law before; under s 4(a) and (d) from the 26th Knesset, from among the justices of the Supreme Court.
-- s 8(b): seven years from appointment, and no second term in the same post.
@ref Courts Law s 8(a), (b); Amendment No. 105 s 5
GIVEN vintage IS A `A vintage of the Courts Law text`
GIVETH A STRING
`the provisions of the Basic Law that appoint the President and the Deputy` MEANS
    IF vintage EQUALS `the text before the 26th Knesset` THEN "s 4(a)" ELSE "s 4(a) and (d)"

GIVEN `the years served in the post` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the term of the President or Deputy has run` MEANS
    `the years served in the post` AT LEAST 7

@ref Courts Law s 8(b)
GIVEN `the person has served a term in that post` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person may be appointed to that post again` MEANS
    NOT `the person has served a term in that post`

§ `Section 14: ending a judge's term by decision of the committee`

-- s 14(b): הועדה וכן ועדת המשנה, אם נתמנתה, יאפשרו לשופט לעיין בחומר שלפניהן ויתנו לו הזדמנות לטעון טענותיו.
-- s 14(c): the decision fixes the day the term ends and, at the committee's discretion, the pension, which may not exceed what the judge would have been entitled to had the judge served until 70.
@ref Courts Law s 14(b), (c)
GIVEN `the judge was allowed to read the material before the committee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the judge was given the opportunity to be heard` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the committee followed section 14(b)` MEANS
    `the judge was allowed to read the material before the committee` AND `the judge was given the opportunity to be heard`

@ref Courts Law s 14(c)
GIVEN `the pension the committee fixed` IS A NUMBER
      `the pension the judge would have been entitled to on serving until 70` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the pension fixed is within section 14(c)` MEANS
    `the pension the committee fixed` AT MOST `the pension the judge would have been entitled to on serving until 70`

§ `Section 25: the number of Supreme Court judges`

-- s 25(a): in the Supreme Court there are judges in the number the Knesset has set by decision.
-- s 25(b), from the 26th Knesset: שני שלישים לפחות מהשופטים בבית המשפט העליון יהיו שופטים שכיהנו בבית משפט מחוזי במשך תקופה כאמור בסעיף 2(1).
@ref Courts Law s 25(b); Amendment No. 105 s 6
GIVEN `Supreme Court judges` IS A NUMBER
      `of them, judges who served as district court judges for the period in s 2(1)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`two thirds of the Supreme Court are former district court judges` MEANS
    (`of them, judges who served as district court judges for the period in s 2(1)` TIMES 3) AT LEAST (`Supreme Court judges` TIMES 2)
